# cspell:ignore nosniff -- the value of X-Content-Type-Options
# Security headers for every path. Netlify applies `_headers` to every deploy, deploy previews included.
# Format: a path, then its headers indented as `Name: value`
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
